{"id":"38bea17cfb6ef378","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence.md","title":"Montagna模式精确刻画框架条件","display":"thm-montagna-frame-correspondence — Montagna模式精确刻画框架条件","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence","aliases":["72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence"],"display":"thm-montagna-frame-correspondence — Montagna模式精确刻画框架条件","depends_on":["[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Lemma13.6(b), print516/PDF528; explicit converse valuation argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-montagna-frame-correspondence — Montagna模式精确刻画框架条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e82291b3e069169\" href=\"?note=3e82291b3e069169\" title=\"72-df-veltman-forcing\">72-df-veltman-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137fba496ea55bfa\" href=\"?note=137fba496ea55bfa\" title=\"72-df-il-ilm-calculi\">72-df-il-ilm-calculi</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Lemma13.6(b), print516/PDF528; explicit converse valuation argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf M_1\">\\(\\mathsf M_1\\)</span> 为本册完整 Montagna 实例集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf M_1\\\n(\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\models_I A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf M_1\\\n(\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\models_I A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向按前一可靠性证明验证 M。反向若有 uS(w)v、vRz 但无 uRz，赋 p₀ 只在 u 真、p₁ 只在 v 真、p₂ 恰在 W{z} 真。在 w，p₀▷p₁ 成立；u满足 p₀∧□p₂，因为它不能看到 z。唯一满足 p₁ 的 v 却不满足□p₂，故后件解释性式失败。于是该 M 实例在 w 为假，与全赋值有效相矛盾。这也核对了 (iv) 的方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veltman-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"3e82291b3e069169","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-il-ilm-calculi","status":"resolved","id":"137fba496ea55bfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf M_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MF}(W,R,S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf M_1\\\n(\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\models_I A).","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"}],"ou